ighRuinRisk_p018:"\u26a0 High ruin risk ({pct}%)",placeholderEx5_p019:"Ex: 5",testimonialsTitle_l001:"What traders are saying",testimonialsSubtitle_l002:"Hundreds of professional and retail traders are already optimizing their strategies with Trading Calculator PRO.",faqTitle_l003:"Frequently Asked Questions",faqSubtitle_l004:"The most common questions before getting started.",testimonial1Quote_l010:"I went from trading blind to having clear R/R metrics, position size, and win rate. My account no longer suffers brutal drawdowns.",testimonial1Author_l011:"Carlos M.",testimonial1Role_l012:"Crypto Day Trader \xb7 4 years",testimonial2Quote_l020:"The Strategy Optimizer and AI Coach save me hours of analysis. I justify the cost each month with a single well-planned trade.",testimonial2Author_l021:"Ana R.",testimonial2Role_l022:"Options Swing Trader",testimonial3Quote_l030:"I've been using it daily for 8 months. The Monte Carlo and journal changed the way I view risk. 5 stars.",testimonial3Author_l031:"David L.",testimonial3Role_l032:"Independent Trader \xb7 Forex",faqQ1_l040:"Do I need to be an expert to use it?",faqA1_l041:"No. The app guides you step-by-step through each calculator, and the Education Center covers everything from basics (what is a Stop Loss) to advanced options strategies. There's a free Demo Trader to try everything risk-free.",faqQ2_l050:"Can I cancel my subscription anytime?",faqA2_l051:"Yes. Cancel with 1 click from your profile. No commitment. If you purchase Lifetime, access is permanent\u2014no recurring payments.",faqQ3_l060:"What assets are supported?",faqA3_l061:"Crypto, Forex (28 pairs), US Stocks (NYSE/NASDAQ), Indices (SPX, NDX, DAX, etc.), Commodities, and Futures. Real-time data via Yahoo Finance.",faqQ4_l070:"Is the Trade Coach AI a separate charge?",faqA4_l071:"No. The AI Trade Coach (Claude Sonnet 4.5) is included in all Premium plans. It analyzes your strategy, identifies risks, and suggests improvements like a senior mentor.",faqQ5_